<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FreshTea Ice Tea</title>

    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffde59, #ffa94d);
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 80px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 4rem;
            color: white;
        }

        header p {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            color: white;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .btn {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            background: white;
            color: #ff7b00;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 30px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .features {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 25px;
            padding: 50px 20px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            padding: 25px;
            width: 280px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #ff7b00;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>🧊 FreshTea</h1>
    <p>Der erfrischendste Ice Tea für heiße Tage.</p>
    <a href="#features" class="btn">Jetzt entdecken</a>
</header>

<section id="features" class="features">
    <div class="card">
        <h3>🍋 Natürliche Zutaten</h3>
        <p>Frischer Tee mit echten Fruchtaromen.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>❄️ Perfekt gekühlt</h3>
        <p>Maximale Erfrischung bei jedem Schluck.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>🌱 Nachhaltig</h3>
        <p>Umweltfreundliche Verpackungen.</p>
    </div>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 FreshTea Ice Tea</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
